---
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-label">03 / About</h2>
      <span class="section-coord">Record · P. Wright</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-main" data-depth="1.5">
        <p class="bio">
          Senior Engineering Manager at Meta, working at the intersection of delightful user experiences, spatial computing, and user trust and engagement. Member of the Board of Directors, FIDO Alliance.
          Builder, transformational leader, tech enthusiast.
        </p>
        <p class="bio">
          By day I lead an engineering team building for XR. Off the clock I ship my own
          products — most recently Marginota, which helps people actually stick with a
          new language by reading real articles at their own pace.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:me@paulwright.dev" class="contact-btn">→ Get in touch</a>
      </div>
      <aside class="about-side">
        <div class="side-label">On record</div>
        <a href="https://engineering.fb.com/2026/02/04/security/cross-device-passkey-authentication-for-xr-devices-meta-quest/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link">
          <span class="ext-kind">Writing · Meta Engineering</span>
          Cross-Device Passkey Authentication for XR Devices ↗
        </a>
        <div class="side-note">
          <span class="ext-kind">Summary</span>
          Role — Senior Engineering Manager, Meta<br />
          Seat — Board of Directors, FIDO Alliance<br />
          Ships — Marginota · PenteXR
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
#about .inner {
  padding-top: 8px;
  padding-bottom: 84px;
}

.about-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 36px;
  align-items: start;
}

.about-main {
  will-change: transform;
}

.bio {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: var(--fg);
  max-width: 560px;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.bio + .bio {
  color: var(--muted);
}

.contact-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 6px;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #000;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  padding: 10px 18px;
}

.contact-btn:hover {
  background: var(--fg);
}

.about-side {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: var(--bg-raise);
  padding: 18px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.side-label {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--faint);
}

.ext-link {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--fg);
}

.ext-link:hover {
  color: var(--accent);
}

.ext-kind {
  display: block;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cool);
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.side-note {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--muted);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  padding-top: 14px;
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .about-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
